{"type":"message","id":"24cff59b","parentId":"dd9aada0","timestamp":"2026-05-02T07:54:10.784Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to provide video titles specifically formatted for Douyin (抖音) video titles - meaning they should be concise, fit the character limit, and work well as the actual title displayed on the video. Let me give them a tighter, more title-appropriate set of options.\n\nThey've been working on 抖音来客投流 (Douyin local life ads) for their exam prep training institution. The titles need to be short, punchy, and suitable as actual video titles.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"抖音视频标题建议控制在15-20字左右，太长了折叠看不全。\n\n---\n\n**首选**：\n> 事业单位进面了，一开口就卡壳怎么办？\n\n**备选**：\n- 面试练了很多遍，为啥还是答不好？\n- 毕节事业单位面试，别闷头一个人练了\n- 毕节考编人，面试这样练更稳\n- 事业单位面试，练对方法真的不一样\n- 毕节面试集训，小班带练学至考前\n\n---\n\n**试跑建议**：拿第一个做主标题跑两天，完播率不行就换\"毕节考编人，面试这样练更稳\"，本地标签更精准一些。\n\n需要我帮你把标题+文案拼成完整的投流素材格式吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":502,"output":361,"cacheRead":25472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26335,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777708441209,"responseId":"ba25bf9c-51be-45cc-a244-b780e855652d"}}
