{"type":"message","id":"042c17cd","parentId":"bbc429bd","timestamp":"2026-05-02T07:59:09.113Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants shorter titles to put directly on the video (overlay text on the video itself), so they need to be very concise - probably 5-10 characters max.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白，放视频封面/贴纸上的话要更短：\n\n---\n\n- 面试老卡壳？\n- 开口就紧张？\n- 答题没逻辑？\n- 面试怎么练才稳？\n- 别闷头练了\n- 开口练，不卡壳\n- 面试练对了吗？\n- 毕节面试，这样练\n\n---\n\n**推荐用**：**面试老卡壳？** 或者 **开口就紧张？**\n\n四个字够短，痛点直接，视觉上好排版。要不要再给你憋几个更短的？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"custom-customad","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":362,"output":189,"cacheRead":25856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26407,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777708742361,"responseId":"6cc7a6f0-d3c2-44db-932e-3194e1a8bf91"}}
